<title>USA: Cintas buys two first aid service cos.</title>
<headline>Cintas buys two first aid service cos.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cintas Corp said Monday it has acquired two privately held first aid service companies.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Cintas said it acquired American First Aid based in Baltimore, and Respond Industries based in Denver. The two companies supply distributors, which service local businesses with first aid supplies.</p>
